= Wave 3 context capture =

'''State: Phase 1 — Context capture.'''

Wave 3 covers natural language, linguistic structure, meaning in use, discourse context, lexical meaning, and computational representations of linguistic meaning. It extends [[Semantics]] from Wave 2 without regenerating or redefining that upstream concept.

